OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy day with occasional
OL,6,Foutbreaks of rain, but also plenty of
OL,7,Fdrier intervals. Rain will be mostly
OL,8,Flight, although the odd heavier burst
OL,9,Fis possible. Light winds, and feeling
OL,10,Frather warm again in the south.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FStaying cloudy overnight.
OL,13,FMore widespread and persistent rain
OL,14,Fthen moving in after midnight. While
OL,15,Fmostly light, there is a chance for a
OL,16,Fspell of heavier rain in the southeast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
